#   Agents: 3 (Helen, Ade, Del)
#   Knowledge sources: 6
#   Exercise 1 (Triage): 17 individuals
#     1 ReasoningContext, 1 Goal, 1 Measure, 5 HardConstraints,
#     1 Plan, 1 ReasoningActivity, 1 Decision, 1 Claim,
#     1 EvidenceLine, 5 EvidenceItems, 1 ConfidenceAssessment
#   Exercise 2 (Contraindication): 20 individuals
#     1 ReasoningContext, 1 Goal, 1 Measure, 7 HardConstraints,
#     4 GradedRules, 1 Plan, 1 ReasoningActivity, 1 Decision,
#     1 Claim, 2 EvidenceLines, 8 EvidenceItems, 1 ConfidenceAssessment
#   Exercise 3 (Procedure Selection): 12 individuals
#     1 ReasoningContext, 1 Goal, 3 Measures, 2 Obstacles,
#     1 HeuristicPack, 4 Heuristics, 1 Plan
#   Exercise 4 (Outcome): 4 individuals
#     1 ReasoningContext, 1 Goal, 1 Measure, 1 Plan
#   Exercise 5 (Capacity): 14 individuals
#     1 ReasoningContext, 1 Goal, 2 Measures, 2 HardConstraints,
#     1 Plan, 1 ReasoningActivity, 1 Decision, 1 Claim,
#     1 EvidenceLine, 4 EvidenceItems, 1 ConfidenceAssessment
#   Exercise 6 (STAMP/STPA): 7 individuals
#     1 ControlStructure, 1 ControlLoop, 1 process individual,
#     3 SafetyConstraints, 1 UnsafeControlAction
#
#   Total: ~83 named individuals exercising 25 of the 42 reasoning classes
#
# Classes exercised:
#   ReasoningActivity, ReasoningAgent, ReasoningContext, Goal, Obstacle,
#   Measure, Decision, Plan, Claim, HardConstraint, GradedRule,
#   KnowledgeSource, HeuristicPack, DiagnosticHeuristic, RiskHeuristic,
#   CoordinationHeuristic, EvidenceLine, EvidenceItem, ConfidenceAssessment,
#   SafetyConstraint, ControlStructure, ControlLoop, ControlAction,
#   UnsafeControlAction, UnsafeControlActionType
#   (Plus 3 existing named individuals referenced: ClearMode, ComplicatedMode,
#    ProvidedWhenNotNeeded, ProbabilityFrame, FuzzyMinMax)
#
# Classes NOT exercised (17 of 42):
#   ReasoningComponent, SoftConstraint, Heuristic (abstract — subtypes used),
#   DecisionMode (class — individuals used), InterpretiveFrame (class —
#   individuals used), CombinationAlgebra (class — individuals used),
#   StructuredProbabilisticComponent, BayesianUpdater, RiskCalculator,
#   PrognosticModel, PredictiveAnalytics, GoalOrderingHeuristic,
#   ResourceHeuristic, GovernanceHeuristic, FRAMFunction, VariabilityProfile,
#   UnsafeControlActionType (class — individuals used)
#
# Of these 17, 7 are abstract parent classes (correctly not instantiated),
# 4 are structured probabilistic types (not relevant to Ears — no validated
# risk calculators or prognostic models in community ear care), and 6 are
# heuristic subtypes or FRAM structures that the Ears domain exercises less
# directly. This is expected — not every domain exercises every class.
#
# =============================================================================
